<section class="story-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE WORLD OF RAQVOI</span><h1>Her style.<br>Her story.<br><em>Her own way.</em></h1><p>RAQVOI is a womenswear brand concept inspired by Indian silhouettes and the quiet beauty of expressive details.</p></div><img src="assets/emerald.png" alt="A richly embroidered emerald dress, displayed on a hanger"/></section><section class="story-manifesto"><span class="eyebrow">THE THOUGHT BEHIND THE THREADS</span><h2>Clothing is personal.<br>Beautifully, wonderfully personal.</h2><p>A favourite colour. A detail you notice. A silhouette that feels like you. The RAQVOI concept brings these small expressions together—through everyday sets, flowing dresses, and occasion pieces.</p><p>This is a preview of that world. A place to explore, imagine, and find your own kind of beautiful.</p></section><section class="editorial-section"><img src="assets/packaging.png" alt="RAQVOI black-and-gold branding on ivory packaging"/><div><span class="eyebrow">A THOUGHTFUL FIRST IMPRESSION</span><h2>From the wrapping<br>to the wardrobe.</h2><p>Ivory, black, and a touch of gold. Our packaging concept extends the same considered aesthetic from the collection to the unwrapping.</p><a href="#/shop" class="button dark">Discover your edit ↗</a></div></section>
